RPG_Station_Sawmill.name = Sawmill
RPG_Station_Sawmill.description = A work station that saws logs into planks. Press use to start working.
RPG_Station_Sawmill.hint.empty = Press [{key}] to load logs
RPG_Station_Sawmill.hint.loaded = Press [{key}] to work
RPG_Station_MountSpike.name = Mount Spike (Dev)
RPG_Station_MountSpike.description = Throwaway dev spike: verifies the standing entity-mount work pose. Press use to start working.
RPG_Station_MountSpike.hint.empty = Press [{key}] to load logs
RPG_Station_MountSpike.hint.loaded = Press [{key}] to work
RPG_Station_CuttingBoard.name = Cutting Board
RPG_Station_CuttingBoard.description = A work station that scales fish and preps them for cooking. Press use to start working.
RPG_Station_CuttingBoard.hint.empty = Press [{key}] to load fish
RPG_Station_CuttingBoard.hint.loaded = Press [{key}] to work
RPG_Station_CookingFire.name = Cooking Fire
RPG_Station_CookingFire.description = A campfire that grills raw fish. Press use to start working.
RPG_Station_CookingFire.hint.empty = Press [{key}] to load raw fish
RPG_Station_CookingFire.hint.loaded = Press [{key}] to work
RPG_Station_CookingPit.name = Cooking Pit
RPG_Station_CookingPit.description = A campfire ringed with stone. Grill raw food over the open flame, or mount a cooking pot above it to cook whole meals. Press use to start working.
RPG_Station_CookingPit.hint.empty = Press [{key}] to cook
RPG_Station_CookingPit.hint.loaded = Press [{key}] to work
RPG_Station_CookingPit.hint.ready = Press [{key}] to collect
RPG_Station_CookingPit.hint.overdone = Press [{key}] to clear
RPG_Station_Cooking_Pot.name = Cooking Pot
RPG_Station_Cooking_Pot.description = A sturdy iron pot. Place it directly above a cooking pit to unlock stewing.
RPG_Food_Hearty_Stew.name = Hearty Stew
RPG_Food_Hearty_Stew.description = A bowl of whatever went into the pot, simmered until it all agrees. Restores health, and a proper mix of meat and greens fortifies both health and stamina.

RPG_Tool_Hatchet_Sawmiller.name = Sawmiller's Hatchet
RPG_Tool_Hatchet_Sawmiller.description = A masterwork mithril hatchet, balanced by countless hours at the sawmill. Keener and sturdier than the forge original.

RPG_Station_Disenchanting_Table.name = Disenchanting Table
RPG_Station_Disenchanting_Table.description = A work station that unmakes one piece of gear per ritual. It gives back what the Salvager's Workbench would, with Life essence on top and the odd find. Hold a piece and press use to place it, then press use again to begin.
RPG_Station_Disenchanting_Table.hint.empty = Press [{key}] to place a piece of gear
RPG_Station_Disenchanting_Table.hint.loaded = Press [{key}] to begin the ritual
RPG_Station_Disenchanting_Table.hint.working = The ritual is under way
RPG_Station_Disenchanting_Table_Greater.name = Greater Disenchanting Table
RPG_Station_Disenchanting_Table_Greater.description = A wider table that takes three pieces of gear at once and works through them one ritual after the next. It pays more essence and finds void more often. Hold a piece and press use to place it in the next free socket, then press use again to begin.
RPG_Station_Disenchanting_Table_Greater.hint.empty = Press [{key}] to place a piece of gear
RPG_Station_Disenchanting_Table_Greater.hint.loaded = Press [{key}] to begin the ritual
RPG_Station_Disenchanting_Table_Greater.hint.working = The ritual is under way
RPG_Weapon_Spellbook_Grimoire_Disenchanter.name = Disenchanter's Grimoire
RPG_Weapon_Spellbook_Grimoire_Disenchanter.description = A grimoire the table drew whole out of a great many unmade pieces. It casts like any other, and in hand it hurries the ritual along. The tables will not take it back.
RPG_Armor_Disenchanter_Head.name = Disenchanter's Hood
RPG_Armor_Disenchanter_Head.description = The hood of the disenchanter's kit, silk. The tables pay it out now and then. Worn, it hurries the ritual along, and the kit worn together hurries it more.
RPG_Armor_Disenchanter_Chest.name = Disenchanter's Robe
RPG_Armor_Disenchanter_Chest.description = The robe of the disenchanter's kit, silk, and the piece that does the most of the four. The tables pay it out now and then. Worn, it hurries the ritual along, and the kit worn together hurries it more.
RPG_Armor_Disenchanter_Hands.name = Disenchanter's Gloves
RPG_Armor_Disenchanter_Hands.description = The gloves of the disenchanter's kit, silk. The tables pay them out now and then. Worn, they hurry the ritual along, and the kit worn together hurries it more.
RPG_Armor_Disenchanter_Legs.name = Disenchanter's Leggings
RPG_Armor_Disenchanter_Legs.description = The leggings of the disenchanter's kit, silk. The tables pay them out now and then. Worn, they hurry the ritual along, and the kit worn together hurries it more.
RPG_Potion_Disenchanters_Draught.name = Disenchanter's Draught
RPG_Potion_Disenchanters_Draught.description = Life essence cut with a thread of void. Drink it and the ritual at a Disenchanting Table runs faster for a while.
